4. Student Service

Service Name: student-service

A. Purpose
Central source for student information and profile management.

B. Main Responsibilities
- Register students.
- Maintain student profiles.
- Find a student by ID.
- Return all students.
- Update and delete students.
- Provide student details to other services through REST APIs.

C. Minimum Data
id
name
email
mobile

D. Required REST Operations
- Add student
- Get student by ID
- Get all students
- Update student
- Delete student

F. Business Example / Flow
Student abhi has ID 101. When enrollment-service receives studentId=101, it calls student-service to verify and retrieve abhi's details.

